  <data name="LotusBulletsTitle" xml:space="preserve"><value>What the integration will bring</value></data>
  <data name="LotusBullets" xml:space="preserve"><value>Lotus dependency kit, confirmed by you in Lotus itself|System diagnostics in each game&apos;s &quot;Fix it&quot;|Performance profile applied while playing and undone when the game closes|Session report with measured values only|Saves and backups protected by Lotus|Your Lotus Ports games inside the Lotus library</value></data>
